4. Microsoft Visual C++ Redistributable (runtime)
-------------------------------------------------
The application and its plugin DLLs are linked against the Visual C++
Redistributable (`/MD`). The Windows package ships those runtime DLLs app-local
(vcruntime140*.dll, msvcp140*.dll) so it also runs on machines without the
redistributable installed; they are Microsoft redistributable components.
